# Per-customer token shares (tokens per minute), keyed <model>__<customer>.
# 35 customers in 4 tiers. Weights: enterprise 8, business 4, growth 2, starter 1.
# For each model, its TPM is split by weight across every customer who may use it,
# so the shares add up to exactly 100% of the model's TPM (no overcommit).
# Growth customers only use the cheaper/mid models.
# Starter customers are NOT listed: they get <model>__default (one weight unit).

